    "content": "<h4>Abjure</h4>\n<p><em>Abjuration Cantrip</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Reaction, when a willing Creature within 15 feet of yourself would take Damage<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 15 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You temporarily bolster a Creature against harm. The Creature who triggered this Reaction gains 1d4 Temporary Hit Points before they take Damage. Any remaining Temporary Hit Points are lost after the Damage is taken.<br><strong>Cantrip Upgrade:</strong> The Temporary Hit Points granted increases by 1d4 when you reach level 5 (2d4), 11 (3d4), and 17 (4d4).</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Abjure\n*Abjuration Cantrip*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Reaction, when a willing Creature within 15 feet of yourself would take Damage\n**Range:**        :: 15 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou temporarily bolster a Creature against harm. The Creature who triggered this Reaction gains 1d4 Temporary Hit Points before they take Damage. Any remaining Temporary Hit Points are lost after the Damage is taken.\n:\n**Cantrip Upgrade:** The Temporary Hit Points granted increases by 1d4 when you reach level 5 (2d4), 11 (3d4), and 17 (4d4).\n:"
