    "content": "<h4>Absolute Zero</h4>\n<p><em>9th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 120 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute</p>\n<p>Choose a point within range that you can see; a frozen cyclone saps the heat out of everything within a 30-foot-radius sphere centred on that point.<br>If a Creature is within the sphere when it appears, or enters the sphere during their Turn, they must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 10d8 Cold Damage and are Petrified until the end of their next Turn as they are frozen solid; on a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are not Petrified.</p>\n<p>[Credit](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/1376888-absolute-zero)</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Absolute Zero\n*9th-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 120 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nChoose a point within range that you can see; a frozen cyclone saps the heat out of everything within a 30-foot-radius sphere centred on that point. \n:\nIf a Creature is within the sphere when it appears, or enters the sphere during their Turn, they must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 10d8 Cold Damage and are Petrified until the end of their next Turn as they are frozen solid; on a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are not Petrified.\n:\n\n[Credit](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/1376888-absolute-zero)\n:"
