    "content": "<h4>Acerbic Flow</h4>\n<p><em>7th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 100 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>A torrent of corrosive fluid blasts from you in a 100-foot-long, 10-foot-wide line. Each Creature in the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 5d8 Acid Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.<br>Then, if this line intersects with a wall or other object capable of providing Total Cover, the acid splashes in a 15-foot-radius sphere centred on the point where the line intersects that object. All Creatures within this sphere must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 5d8 Acid Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Acid Damage dealt by both the line and sphere increases by 1d8 for each Level above 7 it is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Acerbic Flow\n*7th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 100 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nA torrent of corrosive fluid blasts from you in a 100-foot-long, 10-foot-wide line. Each Creature in the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 5d8 Acid Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.\n:\nThen, if this line intersects with a wall or other object capable of providing Total Cover, the acid splashes in a 15-foot-radius sphere centred on the point where the line intersects that object. All Creatures within this sphere must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 5d8 Acid Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Acid Damage dealt by both the line and sphere increases by 1d8 for each Level above 7 it is cast at. \n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
