    "content": "<h4>Acid Douse</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Enchantment</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Bonus Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 90 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 1 minute</p>\n<p>You coat a Creature you can see within Range in a mild acid, enough to inflame sensation and cause pain, but not enough to deal lasting harm. The Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or take 1d8 additional Acid Damage whenever they would take Acid Damage; additionally, they have Disadvantage on Saving Throws against any effect (such as Arts or Operator Skills) that deal Acid Damage. These effects are not cumulative.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Acid Douse\n*1st-Level Enchantment*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Bonus Action\n**Range:**        :: 90 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 1 minute\n\nYou coat a Creature you can see within Range in a mild acid, enough to inflame sensation and cause pain, but not enough to deal lasting harm. The Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or take 1d8 additional Acid Damage whenever they would take Acid Damage; additionally, they have Disadvantage on Saving Throws against any effect (such as Arts or Operator Skills) that deal Acid Damage. These effects are not cumulative."
