    "content": "<h4>Acid Rain</h4>\n<p><em>6th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 200 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Acid begins raining in a 40-foot-radius, 100-foot-high cylinder centred on a grounded point within range. Each Creature in the cylinder not protected from the rain must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed save, they take 5d8 Acid Damage, and are coated in acid. On a successful save, they take half as much Damage, and are not coated in acid.<br>A Creature that is coated in acid takes 2d8 Acid Damage at the beginning of each of its Turns. It can remove this acid as an Action.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Acid Rain\n*6th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 200 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nAcid begins raining in a 40-foot-radius, 100-foot-high cylinder centred on a grounded point within range. Each Creature in the cylinder not protected from the rain must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed save, they take 5d8 Acid Damage, and are coated in acid. On a successful save, they take half as much Damage, and are not coated in acid.\n:\nA Creature that is coated in acid takes 2d8 Acid Damage at the beginning of each of its Turns. It can remove this acid as an Action.\n\n\\column"
