    "content": "<h4>Acid Wave</h4>\n<p><em>4th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You conjure up a wave of vitriolic fluid that crashes down with potent effect; each Creature in a 30-foot cube originating from you must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 5d8 Acid Damage immediately, and 2d8 additional Acid Damage at the beginning of their next Turn. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.</p>",
