    "content": "<h4>Acidify Blood</h4>\n<p><em>5th-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Touch<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Up close and personal, you adjust the pH of a Creature’s blood. Make a Melee Spell Attack against a Creature; on a hit, that Creature is afflicted while you maintain Concentration.<br>An afflicted Creature makes a Constitution Saving Throw at the beginning of each of its Turns. On a failed Save, it takes 3d8 Necrotic Damage + 3d8 Acid Damage, and is Poisoned until the beginning of its next Turn. This Poisoned Condition cannot be removed in other ways. On a successful Save, it takes half as much damage, and is not Poisoned.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Acid Damage dealt increases by 1d8 for each Level above 5 it is cast at.<br>[Credit](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/1199181-blood-to-acid)</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Acidify Blood\n*5th-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Touch\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute.\n\nUp close and personal, you adjust the pH of a Creature’s blood. Make a Melee Spell Attack against a Creature; on a hit, that Creature is afflicted while you maintain Concentration.\n:\nAn afflicted Creature makes a Constitution Saving Throw at the beginning of each of its Turns. On a failed Save, it takes 3d8 Necrotic Damage + 3d8 Acid Damage, and is Poisoned until the beginning of its next Turn. This Poisoned Condition cannot be removed in other ways. On a successful Save, it takes half as much damage, and is not Poisoned.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Acid Damage dealt increases by 1d8 for each Level above 5 it is cast at.\n:\n[Credit](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/1199181-blood-to-acid)\n:\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
