    "content": "<h4>Air Barrage</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 60 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You hurl three bullets of air at Creatures you can see within Range. Make a Ranged Spell Attack for each air bullet. On a hit, the target takes 4d4 Bludgeoning Damage.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> You launch one additional air bullet for each Level above 1 it is cast at.</p>",
