    "content": "<h4>Altar of Bloodcalling</h4>\n<p><em>5th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 24 Hours</p>\n<p>You create an Altar of Bloodcalling at a location within Range. The Altar of Bloodcalling is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.<br>While it is active, the first time each Round a Creature would die within 30 feet of the Altar, their lifeless bodies are possessed for one last strike. They may immediately move up to their movement towards the nearest Creature and make a single attack against them (no Action required); then, they die.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The number of Creatures that can be reanimated each Round is increased by 1 for each Level above 5 it is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Altar of Bloodcalling\n*5th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)\n**Range:**        :: 10 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 24 Hours\n\nYou create an Altar of Bloodcalling at a location within Range. The Altar of Bloodcalling is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.\n:\nWhile it is active, the first time each Round a Creature would die within 30 feet of the Altar, their lifeless bodies are possessed for one last strike. They may immediately move up to their movement towards the nearest Creature and make a single attack against them (no Action required); then, they die.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The number of Creatures that can be reanimated each Round is increased by 1 for each Level above 5 it is cast at."
