    "content": "<h4>Altar of Craving</h4>\n<p><em>4th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 24 Hours</p>\n<p>You create an Altar of Craving at a location within Range. The Altar of Craving is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.<br>While it is active, at the end of each of your Turns, all Creatures within a 30-foot-radius sphere centred on the Altar must make a Charisma Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they lose 4d6 Hit Points, or half as much on a successful Save.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Hit Points lost increases by 1d6 for each Level above 4 it is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Altar of Craving\n*4th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)\n**Range:**        :: 10 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 24 Hours\n\nYou create an Altar of Craving at a location within Range. The Altar of Craving is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.\n:\nWhile it is active, at the end of each of your Turns, all Creatures within a 30-foot-radius sphere centred on the Altar must make a Charisma Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they lose 4d6 Hit Points, or half as much on a successful Save.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Hit Points lost increases by 1d6 for each Level above 4 it is cast at.\n:\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
