    "content": "<h4>Altar of Ending</h4>\n<p><em>9th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: 10 Minutes  (Incantation)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 1 Hour</p>\n<p>You create an Altar of Ending at a location within Range. The Altar of Ending is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.<br>When it becomes active, the Altar creates an Originium Storm; a 30-foot-radius sphere centred on the Altar that goes around corners. Creatures who enter the area during their Turn or begin their Turn within it must make a Constitution Saving Throw, taking 10d8 Necrotic Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.<br>At the beginning of your Turn, the Storm flies 15 feet directly towards the nearest Creature that isn't you or Creatures you designated when casting the Art. The Storm can pass through walls less than 2 feet thick during this movement.<br>The Storm dissipates to nothing after the Duration of the Art has passed, or if the Altar of Ending is destroyed.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Altar of Ending\n*9th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: 10 Minutes  (Incantation)\n**Range:**        :: 10 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 1 Hour\n\nYou create an Altar of Ending at a location within Range. The Altar of Ending is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.\n:\nWhen it becomes active, the Altar creates an Originium Storm; a 30-foot-radius sphere centred on the Altar that goes around corners. Creatures who enter the area during their Turn or begin their Turn within it must make a Constitution Saving Throw, taking 10d8 Necrotic Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save. \n:\nAt the beginning of your Turn, the Storm flies 15 feet directly towards the nearest Creature that isn't you or Creatures you designated when casting the Art. The Storm can pass through walls less than 2 feet thick during this movement.\n:\nThe Storm dissipates to nothing after the Duration of the Art has passed, or if the Altar of Ending is destroyed.\n:"
