    "content": "<h4>Altar of Fealty</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 24 Hours</p>\n<p>You create an Altar of Fealty at a location within Range. The Altar of Fealty is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.<br>While it is active, a barrier is formed in the shape of a 30-foot-radius Sphere centred on the Altar. Creatures on one side of the barrier cannot target Creatures on the other side of the barrier, and vice versa. Arts and similar effects that affect an area also cannot pass through the barrier. However, Creatures can pass through the barrier without obstruction.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Altar of Fealty\n*2nd-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)\n**Range:**        :: 10 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 24 Hours\n\nYou create an Altar of Fealty at a location within Range. The Altar of Fealty is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.\n:\nWhile it is active, a barrier is formed in the shape of a 30-foot-radius Sphere centred on the Altar. Creatures on one side of the barrier cannot target Creatures on the other side of the barrier, and vice versa. Arts and similar effects that affect an area also cannot pass through the barrier. However, Creatures can pass through the barrier without obstruction.\n\n\\column"
