    "content": "<h4>Altar of Hatred</h4>\n<p><em>7th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 24 Hours</p>\n<p>You create an Altar of Hatred at a location within Range. The Altar of Hatred is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.<br>While it is active, the Altar of Hatred makes a Ranged Spell Attack at each of the two nearest Creatures within 50 feet, and who are not behind Total Cover, at the end of each of your Turns. These Ranged Spell Attacks use your Ranged Spell Attack Modifier, and deal 4d12 Force Damage on hit.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The range of the Ranged Spell Attacks made by the Altar increases by 50 feet for each Level above 7 it is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Altar of Hatred\n*7th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)\n**Range:**        :: 10 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 24 Hours\n\nYou create an Altar of Hatred at a location within Range. The Altar of Hatred is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.\n:\nWhile it is active, the Altar of Hatred makes a Ranged Spell Attack at each of the two nearest Creatures within 50 feet, and who are not behind Total Cover, at the end of each of your Turns. These Ranged Spell Attacks use your Ranged Spell Attack Modifier, and deal 4d12 Force Damage on hit.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The range of the Ranged Spell Attacks made by the Altar increases by 50 feet for each Level above 7 it is cast at.\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
