    "content": "<h4>Altar of Retribution</h4>\n<p><em>3rd-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: 10 Minutes (Incantation)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 24 Hours</p>\n<p>You create an Altar of Retribution at a location within Range. The Altar of Retribution is an object with AC 10 and 50 Hit Points. It has Resistance to Physical Damage, and is Immune to Psychic, Poison, and Necrotic Damage. A minute after creating the Altar, it becomes active.<br>While the Altar of Retribution is active, it projects two spheres centred on itself; one with a 50-foot-radius, and another with a 100-foot-radius. When a Creature within the 50-foot-radius Sphere is forced to make a Saving Throw by a Creature within the 100-foot-sphere, they can choose to fail that Saving Throw. If they do, both they and the Creature that forced them to make the Saving Throw suffer the effects of failing that Saving Throw.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> Both radii are increased by 25 feet for each Level above 3 this Art is cast at.</p>",
