    "id": "art-alter-gravity-16548",
    "kind": "art",
    "name": "Alter Gravity",
    "itemType": "spell",
    "sourceHeading": "Alter Gravity",
    "level": 6,
    "school": "transmutation",
    "spellData": {
      "activation": {
        "type": "action",
        "value": 1,
        "condition": ""
      },
      "range": {
        "value": 500,
        "units": "ft",
        "special": "500 feet"
      },
      "duration": {
        "value": 1,
        "units": "hour",
        "special": "1 Hour"
      },
      "properties": [
        "vocal",
        "somatic",
        "ritual"
      ],
      "materials": {
        "value": "",
        "consumed": false,
        "cost": 0,
        "supply": 0
      }
    },
    "castingMetadata": {
      "casting": "Action (Ritual)",
      "range": "500 feet",
      "components": "V,S",
      "duration": "1 Hour"
    },
    "content": "<h4>Alter Gravity</h4>\n<p><em>6th-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action (Ritual)<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 500 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 1 Hour</p>\n<p>You alter the effects of gravity within a 100-foot-radius sphere centred on a point you can see within range. An area cannot be affected by two Alter Gravity effects at the same time, nor do these effects stack.<br>Choose one of the following effects:</p>\n<p>• <strong>Reduced Gravity:</strong> Gravity is weaker in this area. The weight of all objects and creatures in this area is halved. Furthermore, while they are in the area, Creatures gain a hover speed equal to half their walking speed, and take no damage from falling.</p>\n<p>• <strong>Increased Gravity:</strong> Gravity is stronger in this area. The weight of all objects and creatures in this area is doubled and the area counts as difficult terrain. Creatures attempting to use a fly or hover speed within this area must succeed on a Strength Saving Throw or they cannot move using those speeds this Turn. Additionally, the jump distance of Creatures within the area is halved, and Creatures take double Damage from falling.</p>\n<p>• <strong>Repulsion:</strong> Gravity pushes all things and creatures towards the edges of the area. For Creatures in the area, moving 1 foot towards the centre of the area costs 2 feet of movement; conversely, moving 1 foot away from the centre of the area costs only 0.5 feet of movement. A Creature not holding onto a fixed object is pushed 10 feet directly towards the edge of the zone at the end of their Turn. Objects not fixed to the ground are pushed 10ft towards the edge of the zone at the beginning of each of your Turns.</p>\n<p>• <strong>Gravity Well:</strong> Gravity begins to converge on the centre of the area. For Creatures in the area, moving 1 foot away from the centre of the area costs 2 feet of movement; conversely, moving 1 foot towards the centre of the area costs only 0.5 feet of movement. A Creature not holding onto a fixed object is pulled 10 feet directly towards the centre of the zone at the end of their Turn. Objects not fixed to the ground are pulled 10ft towards the centre of the zone at the beginning of each of your Turns.</p>\n<p><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> If cast at 8th Level, the duration is increased to 1 day. If cast at 9th Level, the duration is permanent until dispelled.</p>\n<p>[Credit](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/146333-alter-gravity)</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Alter Gravity\n*6th-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action (Ritual)\n**Range:**        :: 500 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: 1 Hour\n\nYou alter the effects of gravity within a 100-foot-radius sphere centred on a point you can see within range. An area cannot be affected by two Alter Gravity effects at the same time, nor do these effects stack. \n:\nChoose one of the following effects:\n:\n- **Reduced Gravity:** Gravity is weaker in this area. The weight of all objects and creatures in this area is halved. Furthermore, while they are in the area, Creatures gain a hover speed equal to half their walking speed, and take no damage from falling. \n:\n- **Increased Gravity:** Gravity is stronger in this area. The weight of all objects and creatures in this area is doubled and the area counts as difficult terrain. Creatures attempting to use a fly or hover speed within this area must succeed on a Strength Saving Throw or they cannot move using those speeds this Turn. Additionally, the jump distance of Creatures within the area is halved, and Creatures take double Damage from falling.\n:\n- **Repulsion:** Gravity pushes all things and creatures towards the edges of the area. For Creatures in the area, moving 1 foot towards the centre of the area costs 2 feet of movement; conversely, moving 1 foot away from the centre of the area costs only 0.5 feet of movement. A Creature not holding onto a fixed object is pushed 10 feet directly towards the edge of the zone at the end of their Turn. Objects not fixed to the ground are pushed 10ft towards the edge of the zone at the beginning of each of your Turns.\n:\n- **Gravity Well:** Gravity begins to converge on the centre of the area. For Creatures in the area, moving 1 foot away from the centre of the area costs 2 feet of movement; conversely, moving 1 foot towards the centre of the area costs only 0.5 feet of movement. A Creature not holding onto a fixed object is pulled 10 feet directly towards the centre of the zone at the end of their Turn. Objects not fixed to the ground are pulled 10ft towards the centre of the zone at the beginning of each of your Turns.\n:\n\n{{align-text:left\n**At Higher Levels:** If cast at 8th Level, the duration is increased to 1 day. If cast at 9th Level, the duration is permanent until dispelled.\n}}\n\n:\n[Credit](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/146333-alter-gravity)\n:\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
