    "content": "<h4>Aqua Blade</h4>\n<p><em>Evocation Cantrip</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Touch<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Forming water into a cutting edge, you swipe outwards. Make a Melee Spell Attack against a Creature within 5 feet. On a Hit, the target takes 1d6 Slashing Damage, and all other Creatures within a 10-foot cone originating directly behind the original target from your perspective take Slashing Damage equal to your Spellcasting Ability Modifier.<br><strong>Cantrip Upgrade:</strong> The Damage of the initial Attack increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6). At Level 11, the Damage dealt to Creatures within the Cone increases to twice your Spellcasting Ability Modifier.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Aqua Blade\n*Evocation Cantrip*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Touch\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nForming water into a cutting edge, you swipe outwards. Make a Melee Spell Attack against a Creature within 5 feet. On a Hit, the target takes 1d6 Slashing Damage, and all other Creatures within a 10-foot cone originating directly behind the original target from your perspective take Slashing Damage equal to your Spellcasting Ability Modifier.\n:\n**Cantrip Upgrade:** The Damage of the initial Attack increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6). At Level 11, the Damage dealt to Creatures within the Cone increases to twice your Spellcasting Ability Modifier.\n:"
