    "content": "<h4>Avalanche</h4>\n<p><em>7th-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 150 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 1 Minute</p>\n<p>Boulders of ice and sheets of snow form in the air at your command, tumbling down with thunderous impact upon a location you choose within range. The area affected is made up of four 20-foot cubes, which you arrange as you like; each Cube must be contiguous with at least one other Cube, and must touch the ground. Every Creature in the affected area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 4d8 Bludgeoning Damage + 4d8 Cold Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.<br>For the duration of the Art, the area affected by this Art is considered to be Difficult Terrain for non-flying Creatures.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Avalanche\n*7th-Level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 150 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: 1 Minute\n\nBoulders of ice and sheets of snow form in the air at your command, tumbling down with thunderous impact upon a location you choose within range. The area affected is made up of four 20-foot cubes, which you arrange as you like; each Cube must be contiguous with at least one other Cube, and must touch the ground. Every Creature in the affected area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 4d8 Bludgeoning Damage + 4d8 Cold Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save. \n:\nFor the duration of the Art, the area affected by this Art is considered to be Difficult Terrain for non-flying Creatures."
