    "content": "<h4>Blade Art</h4>\n<p><em>Evocation Cantrip</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Bonus Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>This Cantrip can only be cast as a Spellsword Art by an Artsblade. When it is cast, the Attack that this Art was cast as part of deals 1d6 additional Arts Damage. You choose what Damage Type this Damage is; when you cast this Art, choose one of the Arts Pools you have selected for your Spellsword Arts. The Damage Type corresponds to the chosen Arts Pool.</p>\n<pre>| Arts Pool | Damage Type |</pre>\n<pre>|:---------:|:-----------:|</pre>\n<pre>| Corrosion | Acid        |</pre>\n<pre>| Crude     | Force       |</pre>\n<pre>| Earth     | Bludgeoning |</pre>\n<pre>| Electric  | Lightning   |</pre>\n<pre>| Flame     | Fire        |</pre>\n<pre>| Fluid     | Piercing    |</pre>\n<pre>| Frost     | Cold        |</pre>\n<pre>| Light     | Radiant     |</pre>\n<pre>| Psychic   | Psychic     |</pre>\n<pre>| Spatial   | Thunder     |</pre>\n<pre>| Wind      | Slashing    |</pre>\n<p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade:</strong> The Additional Damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Blade Art \n*Evocation Cantrip*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Bonus Action\n**Range:**        :: Self\n**Components:**   :: S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nThis Cantrip can only be cast as a Spellsword Art by an Artsblade. When it is cast, the Attack that this Art was cast as part of deals 1d6 additional Arts Damage. You choose what Damage Type this Damage is; when you cast this Art, choose one of the Arts Pools you have selected for your Spellsword Arts. The Damage Type corresponds to the chosen Arts Pool.\n\n| Arts Pool | Damage Type |\n|:---------:|:-----------:|\n| Corrosion | Acid        |\n| Crude     | Force       |\n| Earth     | Bludgeoning |\n| Electric  | Lightning   |\n| Flame     | Fire        |\n| Fluid     | Piercing    |\n| Frost     | Cold        |\n| Light     | Radiant     |\n| Psychic   | Psychic     |\n| Spatial   | Thunder     |\n| Wind      | Slashing    |\n\n:\n**Cantrip Upgrade:** The Additional Damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6)."
