    "content": "<h4>Boiling Burst</h4>\n<p><em>3rd-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 100 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 Minute</p>\n<p>You begin to concentrate roiling, corrosive fluids at a point you can see within range for the duration. When the Art ends, the fluids burst outwards, and every Creature within a 20-foot-radius sphere centred on that point must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 4d8 Acid Damage, plus 2d8 Acid Damage for every Turn you maintained Concentration on this casting of this Art.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Boiling Burst\n*3rd-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 100 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Concentration, up to 1 Minute\n\nYou begin to concentrate roiling, corrosive fluids at a point you can see within range for the duration. When the Art ends, the fluids burst outwards, and every Creature within a 20-foot-radius sphere centred on that point must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 4d8 Acid Damage, plus 2d8 Acid Damage for every Turn you maintained Concentration on this casting of this Art."
