    "content": "<h4>Burden</h4>\n<p><em>Evocation Cantrip</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 30 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You temporarily increase the effects of gravity on a Creature of your choice within range. The target Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw, or take 1d8 Bludgeoning Damage and have its Speed reduced by 10ft until the end of its next Turn.<br><strong>Cantrip Upgrade:</strong> The Damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).</p>",
