    "content": "<h4>Corpse Explosion</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 50 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You accelerate decay, and thus, the production of gas within a dead Creature of your choice within range. It explodes in a cloud of noxious gas and poisonous fluids; all Creatures within 15 feet of the corpse must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 3d8 Poison Damage, or 3d12 if the corpse was of a Large Creature. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Corpse Explosion\n*2nd-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 50 feet\n**Components:**   :: S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou accelerate decay, and thus, the production of gas within a dead Creature of your choice within range. It explodes in a cloud of noxious gas and poisonous fluids; all Creatures within 15 feet of the corpse must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 3d8 Poison Damage, or 3d12 if the corpse was of a Large Creature. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage."
