    "content": "<h4>Corrode</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 50 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You attempt to burn away the defences of a Creature. Choose a Creature you can see within range; that Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, it takes 2d6 Acid Damage, and is Corroded. On a successful Save, it takes half as much Damage, and is not Corroded.<br>A Creature may attempt this Saving Throw again at the end of its Turn, ending the effect on a success.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Damage of this Art increases by 1d6 for each Level above 1 it is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Corrode\n*1st-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 50 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou attempt to burn away the defences of a Creature. Choose a Creature you can see within range; that Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, it takes 2d6 Acid Damage, and is Corroded. On a successful Save, it takes half as much Damage, and is not Corroded.\n:\nA Creature may attempt this Saving Throw again at the end of its Turn, ending the effect on a success.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Damage of this Art increases by 1d6 for each Level above 1 it is cast at.\n:"
