    "castingMetadata": {
      "casting": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V,S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 Minute"
    },
    "content": "<h4>Fill Lungs</h4>\n<p><em>9th-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 30 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 Minute</p>\n<p>You cause water to enter a Creature's respiratory system in great volumes. Choose a Creature you can see within range; that Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they begin Suffocating. Furthermore, their Movement Speed is halved, they have Disadvantage on all Saving Throws (except Constitution), and Skill Checks. They may attempt this Saving Throw again as an Action on each of their Turns, ending the effect on a success.<br>On a successful Save, they are instead Stunned until the end of their next Turn.<br>This Art has no effect on Creatures that do not breathe.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Fill Lungs\n*9th-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 30 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Concentration, up to 1 Minute\n\nYou cause water to enter a Creature's respiratory system in great volumes. Choose a Creature you can see within range; that Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they begin Suffocating. Furthermore, their Movement Speed is halved, they have Disadvantage on all Saving Throws (except Constitution), and Skill Checks. They may attempt this Saving Throw again as an Action on each of their Turns, ending the effect on a success. \n:\nOn a successful Save, they are instead Stunned until the end of their next Turn.\n:\nThis Art has no effect on Creatures that do not breathe.\n\n\\column"
