    "content": "<h4>Fimbulvetr</h4>\n<p><em>8th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You attempt to snap freeze the area surrounding you. All other Creatures within a 50-foot-radius sphere centred on you must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 10d8 Cold Damage, and gain the Frozen Condition. A Creature can reattempt this Saving Throw as an Action during their Turn, ending the effect on a success.<br>On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are Frozen until the end of their next Turn.<br>When you cast this Art, you can designate a number of Creatures equal to your Spellcasting Ability Modifier + your Proficiency Bonus to be unaffected by the Art.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Fimbulvetr\n*8th-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Self\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou attempt to snap freeze the area surrounding you. All other Creatures within a 50-foot-radius sphere centred on you must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 10d8 Cold Damage, and gain the Frozen Condition. A Creature can reattempt this Saving Throw as an Action during their Turn, ending the effect on a success. \n:\nOn a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are Frozen until the end of their next Turn.\n:\nWhen you cast this Art, you can designate a number of Creatures equal to your Spellcasting Ability Modifier + your Proficiency Bonus to be unaffected by the Art.\n:"
