    "content": "<h4>Forcewave</h4>\n<p><em>4th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>A rush of energy pours from you, bathing your foes, ready to be detonated by a spark. All Creatures within a 30-foot cone originating from you take 4d6 Force Damage. All Creatures hit by this Art are then Primed; the next time a Primed Creature takes Damage, they take 2d6 additional Force Damage.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The additional Damage to Primed Creatures increases by 2d6 for each Level above 4 it is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Forcewave\n*4th-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Self\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nA rush of energy pours from you, bathing your foes, ready to be detonated by a spark. All Creatures within a 30-foot cone originating from you take 4d6 Force Damage. All Creatures hit by this Art are then Primed; the next time a Primed Creature takes Damage, they take 2d6 additional Force Damage.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The additional Damage to Primed Creatures increases by 2d6 for each Level above 4 it is cast at.\n:\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
