    "content": "<h4>Galvanic Gauntlet</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 Minute.</p>\n<p>You charge yourself with electrical energy, ready to release. While you maintain Concentration, you can make a Ranged Spell Attack against a Creature you can see within 30 feet as an Action; on hit, that Creature takes 4d6 Lightning Damage.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Lightning Damage of the Spell Attack increases by 1d6 for each Level above 2 the Art is cast at.</p>",
