    "content": "<h4>Galvanise</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Abjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Touch<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 10 Minutes.</p>\n<p>You empower a Creature you touch with electrical energy. For the duration, their Movement Speed is increased by 10ft and their Melee Weapon Attacks deal 1d6 additional Lightning Damage.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> You can target one additional Creature for each Level above 2 it is cast at.</p>",
