    "content": "<h4>Launch</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 80 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>With a rush of power, you attempt to launch targets into the air. All Creatures within a 10-foot-radius sphere centred on a point you can see within range must succeed on an Strength Saving Throw, or be flung 20 feet directly upwards. They then fall as normal, taking Damage from the fall as appropriate.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The distance you throw Creatures and Objects into the air increases by 10 feet for each Level above 1 this Art is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Launch\n*1st-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 80 feet\n**Components:**   :: S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nWith a rush of power, you attempt to launch targets into the air. All Creatures within a 10-foot-radius sphere centred on a point you can see within range must succeed on an Strength Saving Throw, or be flung 20 feet directly upwards. They then fall as normal, taking Damage from the fall as appropriate.  \n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The distance you throw Creatures and Objects into the air increases by 10 feet for each Level above 1 this Art is cast at."
