    "content": "<h4>Leaf Blade</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Bonus Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Touch<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 10 minutes</p>\n<p>You touch one or two leaves, branches, grasses, or similar plant life. You strengthen and mold them creating the same number of Knives. While these Knives are wielded by you, you can use your Spellcasting Ability instead of your Strength or Dexterity for Attack and Damage Rolls. Additionally, Damage dealt by these Knives is considered to be Arts Damage. At the end of the Duration, the material you used in the Knives withers and rots away to nothing.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Leaf Blade\n*1st-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Bonus Action\n**Range:**        :: Touch\n**Components:**   :: S\n**Duration:**     :: 10 minutes\n\nYou touch one or two leaves, branches, grasses, or similar plant life. You strengthen and mold them creating the same number of Knives. While these Knives are wielded by you, you can use your Spellcasting Ability instead of your Strength or Dexterity for Attack and Damage Rolls. Additionally, Damage dealt by these Knives is considered to be Arts Damage. At the end of the Duration, the material you used in the Knives withers and rots away to nothing. \n\n\\column"
