    "content": "<h4>Leaping Current</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 50 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You launch an bolt of lightning towards a Creature within range. Make a Ranged Spell Attack against that Creature; on a hit, that Creature takes 3d6 Lightning Damage. Then, even if the Attack missed, you can repeat the Attack as if you were in the original Creature's space, but must target a different Creature as the bolt leaps to them.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Lightning Damage dealt by the Spell Attack increases by 1d6 for each Level above 1 this Art is cast at.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Leaping Current\n*1st-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 50 feet\n**Components:**   :: S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou launch an bolt of lightning towards a Creature within range. Make a Ranged Spell Attack against that Creature; on a hit, that Creature takes 3d6 Lightning Damage. Then, even if the Attack missed, you can repeat the Attack as if you were in the original Creature's space, but must target a different Creature as the bolt leaps to them.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Lightning Damage dealt by the Spell Attack increases by 1d6 for each Level above 1 this Art is cast at."
