    "content": "<h4>Lightning Blade</h4>\n<p><em>4th-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You form high current electricity around your hand into something approximating a lance and charge at your foe. When you cast this Art, you may use any movement you have remaining to move in a straight line towards a Creature and make a Melee Spell Attack against them. On a hit, they take 5d10 Lightning Damage + 1d10 additional Slashing Damage for every 10 feet you moved before making the Attack.</p>",
