    "castingMetadata": {
      "casting": "Action",
      "range": "1000 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instant"
    },
    "content": "<h4>Megiddo</h4>\n<p><em>9th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 1000 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Choose up to 10 different Creatures you can see within range. Blinding light strikes down in a 20-foot-radius, 100-foot-high cylinder centred on each of the Creatures; all Creatures within the affected areas must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 10d8 Radiant Damage and are Blinded. At the end of their Turn, they must make a Constitution Saving Throw, ending the Blinded Condition on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are instead Blinded until the end of their next Turn.<br>A Creature in the area of more than one pillar of light is affected only once.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Megiddo\n*9th-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 1000 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nChoose up to 10 different Creatures you can see within range. Blinding light strikes down in a 20-foot-radius, 100-foot-high cylinder centred on each of the Creatures; all Creatures within the affected areas must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 10d8 Radiant Damage and are Blinded. At the end of their Turn, they must make a Constitution Saving Throw, ending the Blinded Condition on a success. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are instead Blinded until the end of their next Turn. \n:\nA Creature in the area of more than one pillar of light is affected only once.\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
