    "content": "<h4>Missile Barrier</h4>\n<p><em>3rd-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 10 Minutes</p>\n<p>You summon eight arcane motes which hover around you.<br>When you are hit by an Attack you can see, you can use your Reaction to expend any amount of these motes; roll 1d4+1 for each mote expended. The Damage of that Attack is reduced by the total amount rolled.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> For each Level above 3 this Art is cast at, you can create 2 additional motes.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Missile Barrier\n*3rd-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Self\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: 10 Minutes\n\nYou summon eight arcane motes which hover around you. \n:\nWhen you are hit by an Attack you can see, you can use your Reaction to expend any amount of these motes; roll 1d4+1 for each mote expended. The Damage of that Attack is reduced by the total amount rolled. \n:\n**At Higher Levels:** For each Level above 3 this Art is cast at, you can create 2 additional motes.\n:"
