    "content": "<h4>Overload</h4>\n<p><em>5th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Touch<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You pour volts into a Creature you touch, scrambling their nervous impulses. The target Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw, taking 6d6 Lightning Damage and being Stunned until the end of their next Turn on a failed Save. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are Dazed until the end of their next Turn instead.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> For each Level above 5 this Art is cast at, it deals 2d6 additional Damage.</p>",
