    "content": "<h4>Permafrost</h4>\n<p><em>4th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 60 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 1 Minute</p>\n<p>You flash freeze a 10-foot cube centred on a point you can see within range; all Creatures within the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 3d10 Cold Damage, and are trapped within the ice. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are pushed to the closest edge of the area.<br>A Creature trapped within the ice is Restrained, but Attacks and Arts cannot pass into or out of the Ice. The Ice is considered to be an Object with AC 8 and 30 Hit Points. It has Vulnerability to Fire Damage, and is Immune to Cold, Psychic, and Poison Damage. If the Ice reaches 0 Hit Points, or the duration of the Art is reached, the ice shatters, immediately releasing all of the Creatures trapped within it.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> For each Level above 4 this Art is cast at, the size of the cube is increased by 10 feet.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Permafrost\n*4th-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 60 feet\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: 1 Minute\n\nYou flash freeze a 10-foot cube centred on a point you can see within range; all Creatures within the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 3d10 Cold Damage, and are trapped within the ice. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are pushed to the closest edge of the area.\n:\nA Creature trapped within the ice is Restrained, but Attacks and Arts cannot pass into or out of the Ice. The Ice is considered to be an Object with AC 8 and 30 Hit Points. It has Vulnerability to Fire Damage, and is Immune to Cold, Psychic, and Poison Damage. If the Ice reaches 0 Hit Points, or the duration of the Art is reached, the ice shatters, immediately releasing all of the Creatures trapped within it. \n:\n**At Higher Levels:** For each Level above 4 this Art is cast at, the size of the cube is increased by 10 feet.\n\n\\column"
