    "content": "<h4>Power Word Aegis</h4>\n<p><em>5th-Level Enchantment</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Bonus Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 60 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Your words form into protective barriers around up to 6 Creatures of your choice that can hear you and are within range. Those Creatures gain 20 Temporary Hit Points.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Temporary Hit Points increase by 10 for each Level above 5 this Art is cast at.</p>",
