    "content": "<h4>Power Word Bleed</h4>\n<p><em>3rd-Level Enchantment</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 60 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Your words physically cut at a Creature that can hear you within range, weakening them. Target Creature takes 10 Slashing Damage, and begins Bleeding.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Slashing Damage increases by 5 for each Level above 3 this Art is cast at.</p>",
