    "content": "<h4>Power Word Kneel</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Enchantment</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Yours is the voice of a monarch; others will kneel. All Creatures with 20 or fewer Hit Points within a 30-foot cone originating from you gain the Prone Condition, as they are forced to kneel to you until the end of their next Turn.</p>\n<p><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> For each Level above 2 this Art is cast at, the threshold for affected Creatures is increased by 10 Hit Points.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Power Word Kneel\n*2nd-Level Enchantment*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Self \n**Components:**   :: V\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYours is the voice of a monarch; others will kneel. All Creatures with 20 or fewer Hit Points within a 30-foot cone originating from you gain the Prone Condition, as they are forced to kneel to you until the end of their next Turn.\n:\n\n**At Higher Levels:** For each Level above 2 this Art is cast at, the threshold for affected Creatures is increased by 10 Hit Points. \n\n\\column"
