    "content": "<h4>Power Word Push</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Enchantment</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>The force of your voice can push lesser beings away from you physically. All Creatures with 20 or fewer Hit Points within a 10-foot cube originating from you are pushed directly away from you to the edge of the area, and have their Speed reduced by 10 until the end of their next Turn. Creatures with more Hit Points than this have their Speed reduced by 10 until the end of their next Turn instead.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> For each Level above 1 this Art is cast at, the threshold for affected Creatures is increased by 10 Hit Points, and the side length of the cube is increased by 5ft.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Power Word Push\n*1st-Level Enchantment*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Self\n**Components:**   :: V\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nThe force of your voice can push lesser beings away from you physically. All Creatures with 20 or fewer Hit Points within a 10-foot cube originating from you are pushed directly away from you to the edge of the area, and have their Speed reduced by 10 until the end of their next Turn. Creatures with more Hit Points than this have their Speed reduced by 10 until the end of their next Turn instead.  \n:\n**At Higher Levels:** For each Level above 1 this Art is cast at, the threshold for affected Creatures is increased by 10 Hit Points, and the side length of the cube is increased by 5ft. \n:"
