    "content": "<h4>Power Word Silence</h4>\n<p><em>6th-Level Enchantment</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 50 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You command a Creature within range to be silent. If that Creature has 60 or fewer Hit Points, they are Silenced and cannot talk in any way. Otherwise, it is Dazed until the end of its next Turn.<br>At the end of each of their Turns, Silenced Creatures make a Wisdom Saving Throw, ending the Condition on a success.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Power Word Silence\n*6th-Level Enchantment*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 50 feet\n**Components:**   :: V\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou command a Creature within range to be silent. If that Creature has 60 or fewer Hit Points, they are Silenced and cannot talk in any way. Otherwise, it is Dazed until the end of its next Turn. \n:\nAt the end of each of their Turns, Silenced Creatures make a Wisdom Saving Throw, ending the Condition on a success.\n:\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:2%,--rotation:90\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/4/48/Peaceful_Valley.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:0px;right:-270px;width:1900px' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:40%,--rotation:0\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/4/48/Peaceful_Valley.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:0px;right:-270px;width:1900px' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:44%,--rotation:180\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/4/48/Peaceful_Valley.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:0px;right:-270px;width:1900px' />\n}}\n\n{{imageMaskEdge1,--offset:33%,--rotation:270\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/4/48/Peaceful_Valley.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:0px;right:-270px;width:1900px' />\n}}\n\n\n\\column"
