    "content": "<h4>Pyroclasm</h4>\n<p><em>9th-Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: 1 Minute</p>\n<p>A destructive wave of heat and flame rushes out in a direction of your choice in a 100-foot cone originating from you. All Creatures within the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 9d8 Fire Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.<br>For the duration of the Art, a Creature that enters the area for the first time on its Turn, or begins its Turn there, suffers the Burning Condition; this Condition cannot be removed while they are within the area.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Pyroclasm\n*9th-Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: Self\n**Components:**   :: V, S\n**Duration:**     :: 1 Minute\n\nA destructive wave of heat and flame rushes out in a direction of your choice in a 100-foot cone originating from you. All Creatures within the area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 9d8 Fire Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.\n:\nFor the duration of the Art, a Creature that enters the area for the first time on its Turn, or begins its Turn there, suffers the Burning Condition; this Condition cannot be removed while they are within the area.\n:"
