    "content": "<h4>Rust</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Transmutation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Reaction, when you are attacked by a Creature using a Melee Weapon<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 10 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You degrade the weapon used to attack you by infusing it with corrosive chemicals. The Damage of that Weapon is reduced by 1. If the Damage of the Weapon has been reduced by 5 in this way, the Weapon breaks, and cannot be used until repaired.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Rust\n*2nd-Level Transmutation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Reaction, when you are attacked by a Creature using a Melee Weapon\n**Range:**        :: 10 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou degrade the weapon used to attack you by infusing it with corrosive chemicals. The Damage of that Weapon is reduced by 1. If the Damage of the Weapon has been reduced by 5 in this way, the Weapon breaks, and cannot be used until repaired.   \n\n\\column"
