    "content": "<h4>Sanguine Spear</h4>\n<p><em>1st-Level Necromancy (Haemomancy)</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 100 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You solidify your own blood into a sharp projectile, which you launch at a visible Creature within range. When you cast this Art, you lose 1d8 Hit Points. Make a Ranged Spell Attack against the target; on a hit, they take 4d8 Piercing Damage<br><strong>Blood Amber:</strong> If there is a Blood Amber within the Art's range, you may consume it to reduce the Hit Points you lose by 1d8.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The loss of Hit Points is increased by 1d8, and the Damage is increased by 1d8 for each Level above 1 this Art is cast at.</p>",
