    "content": "<h4>Septic Shock</h4>\n<p><em>4th-Level Necromancy</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a Creature with a Melee Attack during your Turn<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: Self<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>Tendrils of your withering power dig deep into their body alongside your strike, sickening them; that Attack deals 4d10 additional Necrotic Damage. Additionally, that Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or be Necrotised until the end of your next Turn.</p>",
