    "content": "<h4>Shock and Awe</h4>\n<p><em>3rd Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Reaction, when a Creature within range casts an Art<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 60 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>When someone is casting an Art, that's when their guard is lowest. The triggering Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw, taking 6d8 Lightning Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Damage is increased by 1d8 for each Level above 3 this Art is cast at.<br>.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Shock and Awe\n*3rd Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Reaction, when a Creature within range casts an Art\n**Range:**        :: 60 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nWhen someone is casting an Art, that's when their guard is lowest. The triggering Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw, taking 6d8 Lightning Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save. \n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Damage is increased by 1d8 for each Level above 3 this Art is cast at.\n:\n.\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
