    "content": "<h4>Snap Freeze</h4>\n<p><em>2nd Level Evocation</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 30 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You rapidly chill the air around a visible Creature within range. The target Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw; on a failed Save, they take 4d4 Cold Damage and gain the Frozen Condition. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are not Frozen.<br>The Frozen Creature may use their Action to break free of the ice, ending the Frozen Condition.<br><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> The Damage is increased by 2d4 for each Level above 2 this Art is cast at</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Snap Freeze\n*2nd Level Evocation*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 30 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Instant\n\nYou rapidly chill the air around a visible Creature within range. The target Creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw; on a failed Save, they take 4d4 Cold Damage and gain the Frozen Condition. On a successful Save, they take half as much Damage, and are not Frozen.\n:\nThe Frozen Creature may use their Action to break free of the ice, ending the Frozen Condition.\n:\n**At Higher Levels:** The Damage is increased by 2d4 for each Level above 2 this Art is cast at"
