    "content": "<h4>Stone Shower</h4>\n<p><em>Transmutation Cantrip</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 40 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V, S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Instant</p>\n<p>You form dirt and pebbles into a solid bullet-like projectile, and launch it at a visible Creature within range. Make a Ranged Spell Attack against the target; on a Hit, the Creature takes 1d10 Piercing Damage.<br><strong>Cantrip Upgrade:</strong> You create an additional projectile when you reach levels 5 (2 projectiles), 11 (3 projectiles), and 17 (4 projectiles). Make a Ranged Spell Attack for each projectile; you need not target the same Creature with all projectiles.</p>",
