    "content": "<h4>Wither</h4>\n<p><em>2nd-Level Necromancy</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 60 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute</p>\n<p>You attempt to place a virulent, withering curse onto a Creature of your choice within range. That Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or be Withered for the duration. A Withered Creature takes 2d8 Necrotic Damage at the beginning of each of their Turns. A Withered Creature can make this Saving Throw again at the end of each of their Turns, ending the effect on a success.<br>If the target drops to 0 Hit Points before this Art ends, you can use a Bonus Action on a subsequent Turn of yours to attempt to Wither a new Creature.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Wither\n*2nd-Level Necromancy*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action\n**Range:**        :: 60 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou attempt to place a virulent, withering curse onto a Creature of your choice within range. That Creature must succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw or be Withered for the duration. A Withered Creature takes 2d8 Necrotic Damage at the beginning of each of their Turns. A Withered Creature can make this Saving Throw again at the end of each of their Turns, ending the effect on a success. \n:\nIf the target drops to 0 Hit Points before this Art ends, you can use a Bonus Action on a subsequent Turn of yours to attempt to Wither a new Creature."
