    "content": "<h4>Yggdrasil</h4>\n<p><em>9th-level Conjuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> :: Action<br><strong>Range:</strong>        :: 100 feet<br><strong>Components:</strong>   :: V,S<br><strong>Duration:</strong>     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute.</p>\n<p>You invoke the might of Muel the Feranmut itself, conjuring up an golden image of a mighty tree 100 feet in height and a canopy with a radius of 60 feet centered on a point within range. As a Bonus Action, you can choose up to five Creatures that are underneath the canopy of the Tree. If the Creature is hostile to you, it must make a Charisma Saving Throw; on a failed Save, it takes 3d8 Force Damage, or half as much on a successful Save. If the Creature is not hostile to you, it either regains 3d8 Hit Points or gains 3d8 Temporary Hit Points; your choice.</p>",
    "rawSource": "#### Yggdrasil\n*9th-level Conjuration*\n\n**Casting Time:** :: Action \n**Range:**        :: 100 feet\n**Components:**   :: V,S\n**Duration:**     :: Concentration, up to 1 minute.\n\nYou invoke the might of Muel the Feranmut itself, conjuring up an golden image of a mighty tree 100 feet in height and a canopy with a radius of 60 feet centered on a point within range. As a Bonus Action, you can choose up to five Creatures that are underneath the canopy of the Tree. If the Creature is hostile to you, it must make a Charisma Saving Throw; on a failed Save, it takes 3d8 Force Damage, or half as much on a successful Save. If the Creature is not hostile to you, it either regains 3d8 Hit Points or gains 3d8 Temporary Hit Points; your choice. \n}}\n\n\n\n\n<img \n  src='https://arknights.wiki.gg/images/Ancestral_Tree.png' \n  style='position:absolute;top:00px;right:-700px;width:1900px' />\n\n\n\n\n\\page\n{{pageNumber,auto}}"
